Starting COSMIC
===============

Choose COSMIC in a display manager, or run start-cosmic from a local TTY
login. The PAM session must register with elogind and provide a valid
XDG_RUNTIME_DIR. Do not create /run/user directories in shell profiles.

For audio, configure PipeWire and WirePlumber as described in the Void
Handbook:
https://docs.voidlinux.org/config/media/pipewire.html

The desktop metapackages do not edit PipeWire configuration, keyboard
layouts, application favorites, or per-user directories during installation.
Choose the keyboard layout in COSMIC Settings. Existing locally generated
configuration from older package versions is not removed automatically.
